        <h1 class="post-detail__title">Gratitude for Togetherness</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/50757.webp" alt="Gratitude for Togetherness" loading="lazy">
        </div>

        <div class="post-detail__content">
          <p><em><strong>Unity is strength…when there is teamwork and collaboration, wonderful things can be achieved.</strong>&nbsp;– Mattie Stepanek</em></p>

<p>Your unwavering support is reflected across Teton Valley in opportunities for constituents of all walks of life. Most recently the Community Foundation, through our Youth Philanthropy program, distributed $7,000 in funding to nine organizations for critical community projects including turkeys for the Teton Valley Food Pantry this Thanksgiving, bike helmets and holiday gifts for&nbsp;<font color="#0066cc"><span>local families</span></font> in need, and new safety equipment for the Downtown Driggs Association’s consistent clean-up efforts.</p>

<p>Our recent award for&nbsp;<em>Outstanding Philanthropic Organization</em>&nbsp;from the Idaho Nonprofit Center is a reflection of your backing and belief in the collective good. We are honored to be a hub of support, steady assistance and encouragement for local organizations, nonprofit staff, Boards, and&nbsp;<a>constituents</a>.</p>

<p>Thank you for supporting the locale of Teton Valley with your generosity. Together, your contributions ensure local nonprofits continue to focus their strategic efforts serving our community across every sector. Your support not only funds daily operations but also timely community projects through key competitive grants.</p>

<p>Your unwavering support means collective success for our community.</p>

<p>With our deepest gratitude,</p>

<p>Board &amp; Staff<br>Community Foundation of Teton Valley</p>

